# PostgreSQL 18 client tools for the database backup jobs (pg_dump / pg_restore / psql).
# Consumed by heroku-community/apt (see DEPLOY.md → "Database backups"). The client
# major must be >= the server major, and the database runs PostgreSQL 18. Ubuntu
# noble's own postgresql-client is 16, which refuses it, hence PGDG.
:repo:deb [trusted=yes] https://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt noble-pgdg main
postgresql-client-18
